# ── Scanner artefacts (regenerable; do NOT commit) ──────────────────────────
# hiddenshadow / similar vuln scans dump timestamped xlsx workbooks at the
# repo root. They're produced fresh every run; trying to track them creates
# huge churn and conflicts.
hiddenshadow-scan-*.xlsx

# OSV-DB mirror + scan output directories (underscore prefix is the local
# convention). Regenerable from the scan pipeline.
_cache/
_logs/
sboms/

# Vulnerabilities/ holds two kinds of file:
#   - REMEDIATION.md — hand-authored; should be committed.
#   - hiddenshadow-scan-*.xlsx — regenerable.
# Ignore everything in the directory by default, then unignore the
# remediation doc explicitly.
Vulnerabilities/*
!Vulnerabilities/REMEDIATION.md

# Generated SBOM artifact
sbom.cdx.json

# Security scan result artifacts (scanner output, not source)
scan-*.json
